# Vally writes one timestamped directory per live run here (see scripts/run-evals.sh and scripts/run-evals.ps1).
# Each run holds results.jsonl, events and spans from a real model: keep them local.
vally-results/

# The staged guard hook appends one line here each time it denies a call. Running the hook by hand
# from this folder (Lab 27, section 27.5) creates it in this folder; it is evidence, not source.
.vally-guard-audit.jsonl

# The scratch copy a learner edits to watch a gate fail on purpose (Lab 27, section 27.6).
evals/**/eval.broken.yaml
